Perfect! Let's build a **simple personal portfolio website** using only **HTML and CSS**. We'll keep it clean, minimal, and structured.

---

### 🧠 Project Plan:
We'll create a **1-page portfolio** with the following sections:
1. **Header** – Name and navigation
2. **About Me**
3. **Projects**
4. **Contact**
5. **Footer**

---

### 📁 Folder Structure
```plaintext
portfolio/
│
├── index.html
└── style.css
```

---

### 🔹 Step 1: `index.html`

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Portfolio</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <h1>👋 Hi, I'm Boss</h1>
        <nav>
            <a href="#about">About</a>
            <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <p>I’m a passionate student learning full stack development. I love to build web applications and solve real-world problems through code.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="projects">
        <h2>Projects</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Project 1:</strong> Simple To-Do App using HTML, CSS, JS</li>
            <li><strong>Project 2:</strong> Calculator App using JavaScript</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="contact">
        <h2>Contact Me</h2>
        <p>Email: boss@example.com</p>
        <p>GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/yourusername" target="_blank">github.com/yourusername</a></p>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2025 Boss | All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
```

---

### 🔹 Step 2: `style.css`

```css
/* Basic Reset */
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.6;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    color: #333;
    padding: 20px;
}

header {
    background-color: #333;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 20px;
    text-align: center;
}

header h1 {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

nav a {
    color: #fff;
    margin: 0 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
}

nav a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
}

section {
    background: #fff;
    margin: 20px 0;
    padding: 20px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
}

footer {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 10px;
    background: #333;
    color: #fff;
    margin-top: 20px;
    border-radius: 4px;
}
```

---

### ✅ What You Can Try Next
- Add a profile picture.
- Add animations using `@keyframes`.
- Make it responsive using media queries.
- Convert into multiple pages (About.html, Contact.html).

---

### ⚡ Want to deploy?
Use:
- [GitHub Pages](https://pages.github.com/)
- [Netlify](https://www.netlify.com/)
- [Vercel](https://vercel.com/)

